WEBVTT

01:38.960 --> 01:41.573
[Episode 3]

01:47.959 --> 01:49.280
Hey, Hao.

01:49.280 --> 01:51.120
Is there a girl named Qing Ye

01:51.120 --> 01:52.679
staying at your place?

01:53.799 --> 01:55.164
She's checked into

01:55.164 --> 01:56.400
the ocean view suite.

01:56.400 --> 01:58.382
Keep an eye on her for me.

01:58.382 --> 02:00.904
Let me know if anything comes up.

02:00.904 --> 02:02.000
Got it.

02:02.000 --> 02:03.681
Thanks.

02:13.618 --> 02:15.175
Oh, no!

02:16.786 --> 02:18.240
Hey.

02:18.240 --> 02:19.440
That room of yours

02:19.440 --> 02:20.759
has been vacant for a long time.

02:20.759 --> 02:22.442
It's normal for things to malfunction.

02:22.442 --> 02:23.680
Look,

02:23.680 --> 02:25.105
I need to download study materials.

02:25.105 --> 02:26.920
I can do nothing without the internet.

02:26.920 --> 02:29.400
Then use your cellphone data!

02:29.400 --> 02:32.280
I have huge files to download.
Mobile data isn't nearly enough.

02:32.280 --> 02:35.400
Come on, lady, it's already so late,
and it's pouring rain.

02:35.400 --> 02:38.246
The Wi-Fi repairman
definitely won't come until tomorrow.

02:39.528 --> 02:40.599
What about tonight?

02:40.599 --> 02:42.640
I'll give you the Wi-Fi password
for the room next door.

02:42.640 --> 02:44.655
You can piggyback off theirs for now.

02:46.140 --> 02:47.480
What about the air conditioner?

02:47.480 --> 02:50.657
The AC repairman
isn't coming until tomorrow either, right?

02:52.040 --> 02:53.880
Fine.

03:10.594 --> 03:12.433
What's up, everyone!

03:12.433 --> 03:15.440
Welcome to
the most amazing livestream you'll ever see!

03:15.440 --> 03:17.960
Today, I'm about to drop some talent on you:

03:17.960 --> 03:20.280
unbelievable, never-before-seen stuff!

03:20.280 --> 03:21.920
I promise I'll blow your minds!

03:21.920 --> 03:23.960
For those of you who just joined,

03:23.960 --> 03:27.519
quick, quick! Hit that follow button!

03:27.519 --> 03:29.639
Welcome, "No Cilantro."

03:29.639 --> 03:32.704
Welcome, "Grass is Me."

03:35.319 --> 03:36.680
I'll sing a song for you,

03:36.680 --> 03:38.080
then hit a dance!

03:38.080 --> 03:41.120
Send those little red hearts,
let me see them! Send some likes!

03:50.439 --> 03:52.047
Wu.

03:52.047 --> 03:53.320
The camera is fine.

03:53.320 --> 03:55.480
It's a network issue.

03:55.480 --> 03:56.799
You're here early.

03:56.799 --> 03:58.936
It's barely dawn.

04:00.560 --> 04:01.919
That woman in the sea view room.

04:01.919 --> 04:03.845
Who is she to you?

04:03.845 --> 04:06.109
Last night,
you rushed over in such a panic to find her.

04:06.109 --> 04:07.319
The client.

04:07.319 --> 04:09.600
You don't come across a client

04:09.600 --> 04:11.599
this difficult every day.

04:11.599 --> 04:14.399
I heard you're short on cash again lately.

04:14.399 --> 04:17.239
When have you ever seen me not short on cash?

04:17.239 --> 04:18.399
What's up?

04:18.399 --> 04:19.640
Got a job to refer?

04:19.640 --> 04:21.072
Yeah.

04:21.072 --> 04:22.799
- Want it?
- If it pays, I'll take it.

04:22.799 --> 04:24.479
The more the merrier.

04:24.479 --> 04:26.929
So, do you want a gig to make some quick cash?

04:30.360 --> 04:31.919
How quick?

04:33.960 --> 04:35.239
Call this number.

04:35.239 --> 04:36.399
It gets you

04:36.399 --> 04:38.645
close to two grand a day.

04:38.645 --> 04:40.080
[Computer Geek Repair]
[Yang Gang]

04:42.880 --> 04:44.520
I can't do this job.

04:44.520 --> 04:45.640
Why not?

04:45.640 --> 04:46.760
I know this guy.

04:46.760 --> 04:48.719
He deals in stolen goods.

04:48.719 --> 04:50.880
I wouldn't take that kind of money.

04:50.880 --> 04:53.080
Money is money.

04:53.080 --> 04:54.359
Who cares where it comes from?

04:54.359 --> 04:57.000
There's a famous saying: "Clean money lets you

04:57.000 --> 04:58.599
spend with peace of mine."

04:58.599 --> 05:00.080
Who said that?

05:00.080 --> 05:02.279
The philosopher, Zhou Gui Mei.

05:02.279 --> 05:04.237
Who's that?

05:05.800 --> 05:07.311
Not telling you.

05:07.951 --> 05:09.240
It is done.

05:09.240 --> 05:10.646
So fast?

05:16.990 --> 05:19.335
Thank you, baby, for the big yacht!

05:19.335 --> 05:20.400
Thank you.

05:20.400 --> 05:23.920
Thanks for the gift. Thanks! Awesome!!

05:23.920 --> 05:26.039
Thank you.

05:26.039 --> 05:28.247
Who the hell are you?

05:28.960 --> 05:31.511
Can you keep it down?

05:31.511 --> 05:34.599
- What did you say?
- I said, can you keep it down?

05:34.599 --> 05:36.516
Then come in here and adjust
the volume yourself! Come on.

05:36.516 --> 05:40.360
- Go ahead, adjust it. Let's see what you mean.
- let me go or I'll scream for help!

05:40.360 --> 05:41.480
Let go of me!

05:41.480 --> 05:43.653
Take it easy, man. Calm down.

05:43.653 --> 05:45.760
This is my cousin.
She's been spoiled rotten by her family.

05:45.760 --> 05:47.000
She's a bit high-maintenance,

05:47.000 --> 05:48.200
has a sharp tongue,

05:48.200 --> 05:49.760
and a bad temper.

05:49.760 --> 05:51.520
Please bear with her.

05:51.520 --> 05:52.839
She's your cousin?

05:52.839 --> 05:54.279
- Yes.
- How did you raise her?

05:54.279 --> 05:56.399
She came to my place early in the morning,
shouting and yelling,

05:56.399 --> 05:58.039
telling me to keep it down.

05:58.039 --> 06:00.599
Sorry. My cousin has trouble sleeping.

06:00.599 --> 06:02.919
Whenever there's noise,
she usually yells at me.

06:02.919 --> 06:05.159
I wasn't around this morning,
so she came after you.

06:05.159 --> 06:07.479
I'm truly sorry.

06:07.479 --> 06:08.811
I'll let it slide today for your sake.

06:08.811 --> 06:10.877
Watch it next time.

06:14.399 --> 06:15.880
How am I high-maintenance?

06:15.880 --> 06:17.000
You're not.

06:17.000 --> 06:18.880
Just stop meddling in others' business.

06:18.880 --> 06:21.479
How am I meddling?

06:21.479 --> 06:24.040
Do you know my grandma better than I do?

06:25.279 --> 06:28.200
You mean about ordering the food?

06:28.200 --> 06:30.359
The portions here are just so huge.

06:30.359 --> 06:33.652
I couldn't finish it all by myself,
so I shared it with Grandma.

06:35.039 --> 06:37.200
Why are you here anyway?

06:37.200 --> 06:39.017
To fix the Wi-Fi.

06:39.719 --> 06:42.298
You're the one fixing the Wi-Fi?

06:43.919 --> 06:45.399
I heard you didn't have

06:45.399 --> 06:47.770
a very good night last night.

06:48.880 --> 06:50.239
I'm doing great.

06:50.239 --> 06:52.640
At least there's air conditioning here.

06:52.640 --> 06:54.934
It's much better than Xuan Island.

07:04.466 --> 07:06.370
Sorry to break it to you,

07:06.370 --> 07:07.839
but the air conditioning...

07:07.839 --> 07:09.923
was also fixed by me.

07:17.200 --> 07:18.880
Hello.

07:18.880 --> 07:20.000
Are you extending your stay?

07:20.000 --> 07:21.421
I am.

07:31.600 --> 07:33.000
Wait, the payment didn't go through.

07:33.000 --> 07:35.187
T-Try scanning it again.

07:41.159 --> 07:42.839
Let me handle it.

07:42.839 --> 07:44.920
Okay.

07:58.163 --> 08:01.279
Uncle Sun,
please reply as soon as you see this message.

08:01.279 --> 08:03.212
It's urgent.

08:12.520 --> 08:14.560
Our spendthrift

08:14.560 --> 08:16.411
has money to burn.

08:18.080 --> 08:19.239
I sent you the room fee.

08:19.239 --> 08:21.478
You decide whether to extend.

08:28.147 --> 08:30.479
The AC is fixed.

08:30.479 --> 08:32.119
The guy next door is a long-term tenant.

08:32.119 --> 08:33.640
If you want to listen to his stream,

08:33.640 --> 08:35.160
go ahead.

08:37.908 --> 08:40.239
Thanks for the gift, "Little Cutie"!
Thank you, "My Sky"!

08:41.479 --> 08:45.024
So... extending?

08:45.024 --> 08:46.900
I'm checking out.

09:08.759 --> 09:11.600
How did you get here?

09:11.600 --> 09:14.205
Where is your home?

09:15.040 --> 09:17.450
No home, just like me?

09:18.471 --> 09:19.479
Let me see.

09:19.479 --> 09:20.759
What's your name?

09:20.759 --> 09:22.280
Oh, you have a tag!

09:22.280 --> 09:24.759
Ta Ta, is it?

09:24.759 --> 09:27.267
Your name is Ta Ta?

09:29.719 --> 09:31.988
Where is your home?

09:32.819 --> 09:34.248
Ta Ta.

09:35.160 --> 09:37.839
I told you not to run off.

09:37.839 --> 09:38.999
It's raining so hard.

09:38.999 --> 09:41.008
What if you got lost?

09:41.999 --> 09:44.239
Is this yours?

09:44.239 --> 09:47.107
Let's go. I'll take you home to your mom.

10:01.906 --> 10:02.920
Once you leave here,

10:02.920 --> 10:05.119
Turn left and walk 500 meters,
and you'll find a bus stop.

10:05.119 --> 10:07.000
Three stops and you'll be back in Xuan Island.

10:07.000 --> 10:08.935
So naggy.

10:11.320 --> 10:13.879
[Bus 19: First bus 6:00, Last bus 21:30]
[Bus 51]

10:36.800 --> 10:39.129
- Thanks.
- You're welcome.

11:02.120 --> 11:04.881
[Uncle Sun]

11:05.999 --> 11:07.479
Hello?

11:07.479 --> 11:09.839
Ye, did you call me?

11:09.839 --> 11:11.359
I was busy just now.

11:11.359 --> 11:12.519
Uncle Sun,

11:12.519 --> 11:14.839
my bank card has been frozen.

11:14.839 --> 11:18.080
Is it because of my dad? What happened?

11:18.080 --> 11:19.960
The case is quite complicated.

11:19.960 --> 11:22.239
This is part of
the normal investigation procedure.

11:22.239 --> 11:24.101
Don't worry too much.

11:25.719 --> 11:27.479
I see.

11:27.479 --> 11:29.519
I've transferred some money to you.

11:29.519 --> 11:31.119
Tell me if it's not enough.

11:31.119 --> 11:32.999
Okay.

11:32.999 --> 11:36.198
Thanks for your help, Uncle Sun.

11:45.560 --> 11:47.242
[Let me know if you need more.]

12:10.639 --> 12:12.479
Auntie.

12:12.479 --> 12:15.519
Why are you coming in from outside?

12:15.519 --> 12:16.640
I...

12:16.640 --> 12:18.519
I-I went out for a walk.

12:18.519 --> 12:19.519
A walk?

12:19.519 --> 12:21.891
A walk with a suitcase?

12:23.599 --> 12:25.426
I just want to carry a heavy load.

12:26.440 --> 12:27.774
Oh yeah!

12:28.680 --> 12:31.115
Here. Take this.

12:32.719 --> 12:35.479
Just keep it.

12:35.479 --> 12:38.879
Wu said he can't let you pay for that lock.

12:38.879 --> 12:40.519
Besides, you've already paid

12:40.519 --> 12:41.920
for your room and board here.

12:41.920 --> 12:43.599
We can't take another cent from you.

12:43.599 --> 12:45.960
Otherwise, he'll argue with me again.

12:45.960 --> 12:48.320
Also,

12:48.320 --> 12:49.879
red bean zongzi.

12:49.879 --> 12:51.224
Try some.

12:52.160 --> 12:54.280
I'm not hungry. I won't eat.

12:54.280 --> 12:57.000
No, this wasn't fried in lard.

12:57.000 --> 12:59.120
Wu switched it to rapeseed oil.

12:59.120 --> 13:00.920
Really, he fried it just for you.

13:00.920 --> 13:03.752
Try it and see how it is.

13:04.920 --> 13:07.051
Come on, try it.

13:20.479 --> 13:24.680
- It's actually quite good.
- Good, right? I told you.

13:24.680 --> 13:26.545
I want to try some too.

13:28.800 --> 13:30.040
Auntie,

13:30.040 --> 13:32.280
I was a bit out of line yesterday.

13:32.280 --> 13:33.960
Please don't take it to heart.

13:33.960 --> 13:35.239
Let me tell you,

13:35.239 --> 13:39.879
lard and rapeseed oil
really taste different when fried.

13:39.879 --> 13:43.215
What did you just say? W-What was that?

13:44.519 --> 13:46.024
Nothing.

13:46.024 --> 13:47.160
It's delicious.

13:47.160 --> 13:48.800
Right? I think so too.

13:48.800 --> 13:50.280
I'm going back to my room now.

13:50.280 --> 13:51.719
Wait, wait, wait.

13:51.719 --> 13:53.680
Take another one.

13:53.680 --> 13:55.239
I'll pick a big piece for you.

13:55.239 --> 13:56.920
Okay.

13:56.920 --> 13:58.320
Eat up, okay?

13:58.320 --> 14:00.133
- I'm going upstairs then.
- Okay.

14:07.719 --> 14:09.680
Where's my laptop bag?

14:09.680 --> 14:11.800
What laptop bag?

14:11.800 --> 14:14.920
Oh no! I had two bags with me.
One black, one pink.

14:14.920 --> 14:17.470
I never saw a pink one...

14:18.200 --> 14:19.765
W-What's wrong?

14:22.160 --> 14:23.613
Ye.

14:35.063 --> 14:37.200
Hello, Zhang,

14:37.200 --> 14:38.719
it's me.

14:38.719 --> 14:40.864
Fang from Xuan Island.

14:40.864 --> 14:44.061
Your mom comes to my place often
to get her hair cut.

14:50.320 --> 14:51.406
It's like this.

14:51.406 --> 14:54.879
My niece lost her laptop on the bus.

14:54.879 --> 14:58.545
Yes. I want to see if you can help find it.

15:00.974 --> 15:01.999
Right, right.

15:01.999 --> 15:05.280
Got it. When your mom comes by for a perm,

15:05.280 --> 15:06.920
I'll give her a twenty percent discount.

15:06.920 --> 15:08.151
Gotta go.

15:09.639 --> 15:11.354
The odds aren't great.

15:12.552 --> 15:14.320
Then I'll go file a report
at the police station.

15:14.320 --> 15:15.440
I'll ask the police

15:15.440 --> 15:17.549
to check the surveillance footage.

15:18.479 --> 15:20.680
Get ready for a needle in a haystack.

15:20.680 --> 15:22.400
What do you mean?

15:22.400 --> 15:25.400
That laptop of yours? In all of Zhazhating,
there are only a few like it.

15:25.400 --> 15:26.960
If it's stolen, there are only two outcomes.

15:26.960 --> 15:28.160
Either they keep it for themselves,

15:28.160 --> 15:29.960
or they sell it for cash.

15:29.960 --> 15:32.960
That computer of mine
has a lot of important stuff on it.

15:32.960 --> 15:35.599
I have to get it back.

15:35.599 --> 15:37.800
Wu, you know a lot of people

15:37.800 --> 15:38.876
and have many connections.

15:38.876 --> 15:41.040
Why don't you help her look for it?

15:41.040 --> 15:43.868
It might be more effective than
the CCTV footage.

15:48.479 --> 15:50.359
If you don't want to help, forget it.

15:50.359 --> 15:52.279
I'll go to the police.

15:54.119 --> 15:55.800
Then I'll go with you.

15:55.800 --> 15:57.280
You're a stranger in a strange land.

15:57.280 --> 15:59.082
Ye.

16:01.679 --> 16:03.399
Call this number.

16:04.399 --> 16:05.519
Guarantees you

16:05.519 --> 16:07.159
close to two grand a day.

16:12.399 --> 16:13.899
Hello?

16:17.407 --> 16:18.519
Okay, okay.

16:18.519 --> 16:20.556
Alright, thanks for your hard work.

16:23.320 --> 16:25.080
Officer Xu, how is it going?

16:25.080 --> 16:26.639
Let's sit down and talk. Come on.

16:26.639 --> 16:28.440
Has the security in Zhazhating

16:28.440 --> 16:29.559
become this bad?

16:29.559 --> 16:31.399
She just stepped out and her computer
was stolen.

16:31.399 --> 16:33.679
I really want to see who this thief
actually is.

16:33.679 --> 16:36.159
What's the rush? Can't we sit down and talk?

16:36.159 --> 16:38.080
That laptop is really expensive.

16:38.080 --> 16:39.399
I can't sit still.

16:39.399 --> 16:41.599
We've already looked into your situation.

16:41.599 --> 16:43.800
Just now, I called the bus company.

16:43.800 --> 16:47.479
I asked them to send over the footage
from the relevant time period.

16:47.479 --> 16:49.160
The volume of footage is quite large.

16:49.160 --> 16:51.549
It'll take some time to transfer.

16:52.160 --> 16:53.900
Well...

16:54.479 --> 16:55.839
How about this?

16:55.839 --> 16:57.359
Auntie, you go back to the shop.

16:57.359 --> 16:59.519
I'll watch it myself.

16:59.519 --> 17:01.960
That's great.

17:01.960 --> 17:03.680
- Thank you, Officer Xu.
- You're welcome.

17:03.680 --> 17:05.378
I'm leaving.

17:07.960 --> 17:10.079
Then come with me.

17:23.239 --> 17:24.319
I'm here.

17:24.319 --> 17:26.039
Where are you?

17:26.039 --> 17:27.479
Keep going straight.

17:27.479 --> 17:28.479
There's a blue door.

17:28.479 --> 17:31.277
Honk twice when you get there.

17:46.479 --> 17:48.614
You must be Xing Wu.

17:49.479 --> 17:50.999
That's me.

17:56.160 --> 17:58.079
I've heard a lot about you.

17:58.079 --> 18:00.400
I heard you have a history with Cao Ping.

18:14.840 --> 18:17.239
Does that have anything to do
with taking the job?

18:20.160 --> 18:21.600
Fair point.

18:21.600 --> 18:22.799
The grudge between you two has
noting to do with me.

18:22.799 --> 18:25.221
He'll settle it with you when he gets out.

18:25.880 --> 18:27.400
Come on in.

18:52.239 --> 18:54.666
Yes, that's him.

18:58.079 --> 19:00.872
He's blocking his face, it's hard to see.

19:01.680 --> 19:03.640
Looks like a repeat offender.

19:03.640 --> 19:05.600
He didn't show his face at all.

19:07.400 --> 19:08.759
Can I get my laptop back?

19:08.759 --> 19:10.079
We'll do our best.

19:10.079 --> 19:12.808
Okay, thank you then.

19:18.719 --> 19:20.039
So, what do you think?

19:20.039 --> 19:21.680
This place is pretty good.

19:21.680 --> 19:23.479
Is my business

19:23.479 --> 19:25.319
big enough for you?

19:25.319 --> 19:27.120
Do you like it?

19:37.120 --> 19:39.160
Can you handle this much work?

19:39.160 --> 19:40.479
I can't.

19:40.479 --> 19:42.840
That's why I'm short-staffed.

19:48.779 --> 19:50.239
Buddy,

19:50.239 --> 19:53.735
how long does it usually take you
to change a phone battery?

19:54.479 --> 19:55.559
About five minutes.

19:55.559 --> 19:56.640
Five minutes?

19:56.640 --> 19:58.140
You...

20:03.079 --> 20:05.079
Show me you can do it in five minutes.

20:51.160 --> 20:52.880
Not bad, bro!

20:52.880 --> 20:54.079
You're faster than both

20:54.079 --> 20:56.519
my technicians combined.

20:56.519 --> 20:57.880
I heard you have...

20:57.880 --> 21:00.079
tougher jobs here.

21:00.079 --> 21:02.073
And better pay?

21:02.920 --> 21:04.719
Want to make money?

21:05.960 --> 21:07.920
- Yes.
- Straightforward.

21:07.920 --> 21:09.680
Then show me what you can do.

21:09.680 --> 21:10.960
Come.

21:11.960 --> 21:13.559
Come here.

21:18.960 --> 21:20.519
Newer devices

21:20.519 --> 21:21.960
get flashed and refurbished.

21:21.960 --> 21:24.920
Worn-out ones are stripped for parts.

21:24.920 --> 21:26.880
You get paid per piece.

21:31.920 --> 21:33.479
You are pretty sharp.

21:33.479 --> 21:35.479
I just got it.

21:35.479 --> 21:36.519
Wipe the accounts,

21:36.519 --> 21:38.680
flash it, then sell it as new.

21:41.160 --> 21:43.261
Sourced through a legal channel?

21:44.120 --> 21:46.120
Don't ask what you should not ask.

21:46.120 --> 21:48.519
You'll get paid.

21:51.840 --> 21:53.120
Gang,

21:53.120 --> 21:54.840
I am not cut out

21:54.840 --> 21:58.079
for anything illegal.

21:58.079 --> 21:59.485
How about this,

21:59.485 --> 22:02.461
I am here to buy something today.

22:03.155 --> 22:04.960
What do you mean?

22:04.960 --> 22:06.492
I will take this one.

22:06.492 --> 22:08.299
Name your price.

22:11.999 --> 22:13.239
Fine.

22:14.239 --> 22:15.920
16,000 yuan.

22:17.120 --> 22:20.160
If you can pay the price,
the laptop is yours.

22:20.160 --> 22:22.840
You bought this for less than 2,000 yuan.

22:22.840 --> 22:25.079
Now you are selling it to me at full price.

22:25.079 --> 22:26.519
Do you take me for a fool?

22:26.519 --> 22:27.905
Xing Wu,

22:28.612 --> 22:30.880
are you here to cause trouble?

22:33.600 --> 22:34.680
Listen,

22:34.680 --> 22:35.880
if you can't pay,

22:35.880 --> 22:39.296
neither you nor the laptop is leaving.

22:41.479 --> 22:43.680
What if I insist on leaving?

22:45.360 --> 22:46.920
Then it depends

22:46.920 --> 22:49.400
on whether you have what it takes.

22:53.400 --> 22:56.200
You have so many phones
and laptops of unknown origin.

22:56.200 --> 22:58.355
Do you want to go back to prison again?

23:00.056 --> 23:01.281
You know

23:01.281 --> 23:03.501
how Cao Ping ended up in prison.

23:12.160 --> 23:13.660
Hello?

23:15.400 --> 23:18.162
Wu, take it easy.

23:18.840 --> 23:19.920
Can I take the laptop?

23:19.920 --> 23:21.745
Take it. Take it.

23:24.960 --> 23:26.039
2,000 yuan.

23:26.039 --> 23:28.279
Money can be earned back.

23:28.279 --> 23:30.079
You know the rules.

23:31.319 --> 23:32.719
Yeah.

23:32.719 --> 23:34.259
I know.

23:34.880 --> 23:36.759
Wu, take the money and we're done.

23:36.759 --> 23:38.360
Goodbye.

23:59.559 --> 24:00.759
Officer Xu.

24:00.759 --> 24:02.880
I found something wrong
with Yang Gang's repair center.

24:02.880 --> 24:05.039
You should keep an eye on it.

24:13.279 --> 24:15.519
Auntie, I'm back.

24:17.160 --> 24:18.160
You're back.

24:18.160 --> 24:19.239
I fell asleep.

24:19.239 --> 24:21.239
How was it? Have you found the thief?

24:21.239 --> 24:22.600
I found him,

24:22.600 --> 24:24.039
but I didn't see his face clearly.

24:24.039 --> 24:25.479
Did not see his face?

24:25.479 --> 24:27.840
Then... what about the laptop?

24:27.840 --> 24:30.360
The laptop... Officer Xu said

24:30.360 --> 24:31.479
it is still under investigation.

24:31.479 --> 24:33.600
It'll take some time.

24:35.759 --> 24:38.559
Alright. Don't worry about it.

24:38.559 --> 24:41.479
It is still under investigation anyway.

24:42.519 --> 24:44.682
My laptop?

24:48.160 --> 24:49.640
I knew it.

24:49.640 --> 24:51.039
Zhazhating

24:51.039 --> 24:53.880
is full of talented people
and beautiful scenery.

24:53.880 --> 24:54.999
There are kind people

24:54.999 --> 24:56.360
who quietly do good deeds here.

24:56.360 --> 24:57.680
Check it. Is it in good condition?

24:57.680 --> 24:59.563
It is fine.

25:00.840 --> 25:04.680
I guess my luck is just too good.

25:04.680 --> 25:07.999
So once people knew we lost a laptop,

25:07.999 --> 25:10.200
they returned it.

25:10.200 --> 25:11.519
If it were me,

25:11.519 --> 25:13.680
I'd definitely give this kind person

25:13.680 --> 25:15.360
a banner of thanks.

25:15.360 --> 25:20.031
And I would even kowtow three times

25:20.731 --> 25:25.799
to show my sincere gratitude.

25:26.627 --> 25:28.547
You found the laptop?

25:30.519 --> 25:33.279
Son, you're home?

25:33.279 --> 25:35.693
It's found!

25:36.719 --> 25:37.960
Since the laptop is back,

25:37.960 --> 25:39.559
I'll head next door.

25:39.559 --> 25:41.160
Remember to feed Fa Cai.

25:41.160 --> 25:42.400
Don't keep feeding Yao Ji.

25:42.400 --> 25:44.200
It is getting fat. I'm off now.

25:44.200 --> 25:46.892
The skinny one is Yao Ji.

25:58.880 --> 26:00.799
Can you even tell which is Fa Cai

26:00.799 --> 26:02.653
and which is Yao Ji?

26:03.519 --> 26:05.757
Of course I can.

26:09.999 --> 26:11.400
This one,

26:11.400 --> 26:12.680
the thinnest and smallest,

26:12.680 --> 26:14.200
is Yao Ji.

26:14.200 --> 26:15.840
This one is Bai Ban.

26:15.840 --> 26:17.640
That one is Fa Cai.

26:24.120 --> 26:25.999
You're hurt.

26:29.160 --> 26:30.680
It's nothing.

26:33.120 --> 26:34.912
My laptop...

26:35.559 --> 26:37.883
You were the one who
found my laptop, right?

26:43.759 --> 26:45.479
If you want to think so,

26:45.479 --> 26:47.364
it could be me.

26:50.920 --> 26:52.519
What?

26:52.519 --> 26:55.015
Want to kowtow to me three times?

26:55.015 --> 26:56.774
In your dreams.

27:08.920 --> 27:10.680
He doesn't seem

27:10.680 --> 27:13.319
as terrible as I thought.

27:32.279 --> 27:33.920
What's up?

27:42.200 --> 27:44.400
I have some medicine left

27:44.400 --> 27:45.920
from Dr. Zhuang.

27:45.920 --> 27:47.420
Take it.

27:53.005 --> 27:55.412
It is just a minor injury.
I do not need it.

28:09.239 --> 28:10.840
Thanks anyway.

28:13.360 --> 28:14.680
They beat you up like this.

28:14.680 --> 28:16.680
Did you call the police?

28:17.360 --> 28:18.519
I told Officer Xu.

28:18.519 --> 28:20.437
They'll investigate.

29:01.640 --> 29:03.587
Xing Wu?

29:07.479 --> 29:09.479
What are you doing here?

29:11.218 --> 29:12.709
Working?

29:13.360 --> 29:16.479
I suggest you do not stand here.

29:16.479 --> 29:17.479
Why?

29:17.479 --> 29:19.403
Am I in your way?

29:21.519 --> 29:23.501
I'm afraid you'll get hit.

29:24.200 --> 29:26.479
You're scaring me again.

29:28.559 --> 29:29.799
Believe it or not.

29:29.799 --> 29:31.079
I don't believe you.

29:31.079 --> 29:33.759
Make way. Move...

29:49.360 --> 29:50.920
It's my turn.

29:50.920 --> 29:52.680
Give me a good hand.

29:52.680 --> 29:54.999
4-bamboo tile.

29:54.999 --> 29:56.396
- My turn.
- Right, I forgot.

29:56.396 --> 29:59.424
What are you thinking about?

29:59.424 --> 30:00.544
West Wind.

30:00.544 --> 30:02.436
West Wind.

30:02.436 --> 30:06.360
- Did I get it wrong? It's my turn.
- 1-bamboo tile.

30:06.360 --> 30:07.508
Auntie.

30:07.508 --> 30:10.880
The Wi-Fi... keeps cutting out.
Is something wrong with it?

30:10.880 --> 30:14.146
The Wi-Fi on the second floor is bad.
There is a router next to the cashier.

30:14.146 --> 30:16.880
Just unplug it and plug it back in.

30:16.880 --> 30:19.091
West Wind.

30:34.566 --> 30:37.719
Cousin. Here's the fruit you wanted.

30:37.719 --> 30:39.039
I went to the town to buy them.

30:39.039 --> 30:41.200
It is special, just for you.

30:41.200 --> 30:44.276
- ♫I just want to show you my care♫
- Stop, stop.

30:44.276 --> 30:48.307
I asked for imported cherries and avocados.

30:49.519 --> 30:50.960
Don't you think I know that?

30:50.960 --> 30:53.160
Imported cherries are just cherries.

30:53.160 --> 30:55.517
As for the avocados...

30:55.517 --> 30:57.279
I went to two stores
and still could not find it.

30:57.279 --> 30:58.960
Just eat. Try the figs.

30:58.960 --> 31:01.920
Same thing. They're all fruit.

31:01.920 --> 31:02.960
You... you...

31:02.960 --> 31:04.799
Are they washed?

31:04.799 --> 31:06.550
Are they washed?

31:06.550 --> 31:08.640
Yeah, they're washed.

31:13.006 --> 31:14.782
How is it?

31:14.782 --> 31:17.680
The fruit in Zhazhating isn't bad, right?

31:17.680 --> 31:19.479
Not bad.

31:19.479 --> 31:22.200
If you like them, I'll buy them
for you every day.

31:23.400 --> 31:24.680
- Fuzz!
- Eat.

31:24.680 --> 31:26.960
Come and help out.

31:26.960 --> 31:28.120
- Okay.
- Hao Cheng Gong.

31:28.120 --> 31:30.239
Eat up, Cousin.

31:30.239 --> 31:33.002
Nag, nag, nag.

31:33.961 --> 31:35.793
1-dot tile.

31:36.999 --> 31:39.279
Give me a good hand!

31:39.279 --> 31:40.759
What's this?

31:40.759 --> 31:43.360
- 4-bamboo tile.
- Give me a good hand.

31:43.360 --> 31:46.240
Ye, my... my mom

31:46.240 --> 31:48.664
made it especially for you.

31:49.276 --> 31:51.031
That's so much.

31:51.031 --> 31:52.039
She said,

31:52.039 --> 31:53.680
you should have four dishes
and a soup per meal too.

31:53.680 --> 31:55.279
But the portions are halved.

31:55.279 --> 31:56.559
This is halved?

31:56.559 --> 31:58.417
This... This is just a
standard portion in Zhazhating.

31:58.417 --> 32:01.039
Help yourself.

32:01.039 --> 32:02.279
Eat some fruit.

32:02.279 --> 32:03.840
Hello, bosses.

32:03.840 --> 32:05.360
Time to eat!

32:05.360 --> 32:06.719
You've worked hard, son.

32:06.719 --> 32:07.999
Hurry up, I'm starving.

32:07.999 --> 32:09.719
- I'm hungry too.
- Hurry, hurry.

32:09.719 --> 32:12.600
- Coming right up!
- Don't put it there.

32:12.600 --> 32:14.319
Thank you, son.

32:14.319 --> 32:15.799
Your mom is one tile away from winning.

32:15.799 --> 32:17.120
Try one.

32:17.120 --> 32:19.474
Have one.

32:21.719 --> 32:23.200
You little cutie Hu.

32:23.200 --> 32:24.999
You look so innocent and honest,

32:24.999 --> 32:26.479
but you're playing favorites!

32:26.479 --> 32:29.120
Look! The fish balls in your mom's bowl

32:29.120 --> 32:31.200
are more than all of ours combined!

32:31.200 --> 32:35.519
It wasn't me. My dad just hand-rolled
these fish balls.

32:35.519 --> 32:37.200
He wanted my mom to have more.

32:37.200 --> 32:39.880
I see. It's not playing favorites.

32:39.880 --> 32:44.400
It's your dad's...
exclusive affection for your mom.

32:44.400 --> 32:45.799
Hurry up and eat yours.

32:45.799 --> 32:46.999
Go take some to Grandma.

32:46.999 --> 32:48.200
Grandma, time to eat.

32:48.200 --> 32:49.559
- Whose turn is it? Whose turn?
- Whose turn?

32:49.559 --> 32:51.880
- My turn, my turn, my turn!
- Hurry up.

32:51.880 --> 32:54.039
- Give me a good one. Seven Circles!
- Don't interrupt.

32:54.039 --> 32:56.120
What are you thinking for?
Just play it and be done with it.

32:56.120 --> 32:58.840
- What are you doing?
- Go on, go do what you need to do.

32:59.880 --> 33:01.400
Son, you are off? Don't forget to
take your medicine.

33:01.400 --> 33:02.672
Mom, remember to have the meal.

33:02.672 --> 33:03.880
Hu,

33:03.880 --> 33:05.559
Does Zhazhating

33:05.559 --> 33:08.759
have any other specialties?

33:08.759 --> 33:11.722
- Of course.
- There definitely are.

33:17.479 --> 33:20.640
What are all these?

33:20.640 --> 33:23.360
This is our local specialty drink.

33:23.360 --> 33:24.759
Zhazha Drink.

33:24.759 --> 33:27.031
It's delicious.

33:32.079 --> 33:34.120
- It's not bad.
- Here.

33:34.120 --> 33:35.759
Try some specialty skewers in Zhazhating.

33:35.759 --> 33:37.912
Zhazha Skewers.

33:43.079 --> 33:44.719
- How is it?
- This is good too.

33:44.719 --> 33:46.200
Right?

33:46.200 --> 33:48.165
It's okay.

33:49.173 --> 33:50.519
By the way,

33:50.519 --> 33:52.120
why did Wu drop out of school?

33:52.120 --> 33:53.799
He dropped out a long time ago.

33:53.799 --> 33:55.400
He's been out in the world for two years.

33:55.400 --> 33:56.400
He...

33:56.400 --> 33:58.999
He quit during his senior year.

33:58.999 --> 34:02.600
His mom has been keeping his enrollment active.

34:02.600 --> 34:04.360
Wu has to earn money.

34:04.360 --> 34:05.600
A family of three...

34:05.600 --> 34:07.120
plus Liu Nian.

34:07.120 --> 34:09.303
They all depend on him.

34:10.320 --> 34:11.639
Anyway, he's just one word:

34:11.639 --> 34:13.244
Awesome.

34:14.360 --> 34:15.479
That impressive?

34:15.479 --> 34:16.720
He's smart and tough.

34:16.720 --> 34:18.479
He can fix anything.

34:18.479 --> 34:19.999
And he's the most loyal.

34:19.999 --> 34:21.800
A good brother.

34:21.800 --> 34:23.320
The head of the family.

34:23.320 --> 34:25.639
He's very responsible.

34:25.639 --> 34:26.679
To put it simply,

34:26.679 --> 34:28.479
he's the most promising

34:28.479 --> 34:30.400
and amazing man in Zhazhating.

34:31.800 --> 34:34.039
He's a Zhazhating specialty too.

34:34.039 --> 34:35.920
He's not "scam" - he's great.

34:35.920 --> 34:37.240
How great can he be?

34:37.240 --> 34:39.039
Can he fly to the moon?

34:39.039 --> 34:41.079
Actually, he almost did.

34:41.079 --> 34:43.519
The plane he made flew so high.

34:43.519 --> 34:45.159
Wu used to be a top student.

34:45.159 --> 34:48.039
Shortly after his senior year started,
he dropped out.

34:48.039 --> 34:49.240
He had no choice.

34:49.240 --> 34:50.880
Our teacher and Aunt Lanfang

34:50.880 --> 34:52.280
both wanted him to return.

34:52.280 --> 34:53.280
If it weren't for two years ago...

34:53.280 --> 34:54.599
Fuzz,

34:54.599 --> 34:56.360
Watch your mouth.

34:56.360 --> 34:59.559
Didn't Wu forbid you
from talking about his past?

34:59.559 --> 35:02.400
She isn't an outsider.

35:02.400 --> 35:04.862
If it weren't for two years ago...

35:07.479 --> 35:09.999
If you're curious, ask him yourself.

35:09.999 --> 35:12.280
I'm not that curious.

35:12.280 --> 35:14.240
Wh-Whose computer is this?

35:14.240 --> 35:15.730
Pocky, what are you doing?

35:15.730 --> 35:17.639
Why did you splash water on it?

35:17.639 --> 35:18.639
- It's fine.
- Oh! Hurry, hurry!

35:18.639 --> 35:20.440
It's just a little water.

35:20.440 --> 35:23.157
What's wrong?

35:23.157 --> 35:24.559
Oh! My computer...

35:24.559 --> 35:27.360
I haven't picked my classes yet. It...

35:30.479 --> 35:31.880
It won't turn on.

35:31.880 --> 35:34.008
- It's soaked.
- It's okay, just a little water.

35:34.008 --> 35:35.100
I'll wipe it with a rag.

35:35.100 --> 35:36.601
A hair dryer will fix it right up.

35:36.601 --> 35:39.720
- No, no, no!
- She needs that computer to go abroad.

35:39.720 --> 35:42.360
I was just having a cup of water.
I didn't see her computer right there.

35:42.360 --> 35:43.599
Is it that serious?

35:43.599 --> 35:45.280
I'll pay for the damages.

35:45.280 --> 35:48.159
This computer has high-end specs.

35:48.159 --> 35:50.999
It'll cost at least a thousand to fix.

35:51.999 --> 35:53.920
That expensive?

35:53.920 --> 35:55.240
You've really done it now.

35:55.240 --> 35:57.559
Why not let Wu take a look?

35:57.559 --> 35:59.103
Right, Wu can fix it.

35:59.103 --> 36:01.283
Do you have an authorized service center?

36:01.283 --> 36:02.270
Service center? No.

36:02.270 --> 36:04.639
- I don't think so.
- No, never heard of one.

36:04.639 --> 36:06.400
Then, where is the nearest repair shop?

36:06.400 --> 36:07.639
Where is it?

36:07.639 --> 36:09.479
- It's at Erqiao.
- Erqiao.

36:09.479 --> 36:11.880
Qing Ye! Qing...

36:20.559 --> 36:23.159
Sir! Can you ride me to Erqiao?

36:23.159 --> 36:25.039
Little girl, it's you again.

36:25.039 --> 36:26.570
Let's go! Come on.

36:26.570 --> 36:30.755
By the way, please take me to
the best computer repairman around here.

36:30.755 --> 36:32.479
Then you've hailed the right car.

36:32.479 --> 36:34.892
Sit tight and put on the helmet.

36:44.999 --> 36:48.339
♪ Let me accept ♪

36:53.720 --> 36:54.880
Sir.

36:54.880 --> 36:56.760
Sir, could you please go faster?

36:56.760 --> 36:58.240
Little girl,

36:58.240 --> 36:59.400
in our life,

36:59.400 --> 37:01.400
we shouldn't always be in such a rush.

37:01.400 --> 37:03.840
We should stop once in a while

37:03.840 --> 37:05.599
to enjoy the scenery along the way.

37:05.599 --> 37:07.119
Don't you think so?

37:08.119 --> 37:10.360
I'll pay double.

37:10.360 --> 37:11.840
It's not about the money.

37:11.840 --> 37:14.320
I'm not even charging you for this.

37:14.320 --> 37:16.280
But I'm in a hurry, sir.

37:16.280 --> 37:18.064
It's an absolute emergency.

37:18.064 --> 37:19.304
An absolute emergency?

37:19.304 --> 37:20.720
Why didn't you say so earlier?

37:20.720 --> 37:22.320
Hold on tight.

37:22.320 --> 37:23.920
Here we go!

37:38.091 --> 37:39.639
We're here, little girl.

37:39.639 --> 37:42.320
For phone and computer repairs,
Ju Huang is the place.

37:42.320 --> 37:44.320
Ju Huang?

37:44.320 --> 37:45.530
Trust me, you can't go wrong.

37:45.530 --> 37:47.199
Go on.

37:47.199 --> 37:49.260
- Thanks.
- Sure thing.

37:57.679 --> 37:59.199
Hello.

38:10.720 --> 38:12.280
Hello.

38:14.392 --> 38:15.999
Who are you looking for?

38:15.999 --> 38:17.960
Are you Mr.Ju?

38:17.960 --> 38:19.953
I'm here to get my computer fixed.

38:19.953 --> 38:21.780
Looking for Mr.Ju?

38:21.780 --> 38:22.960
Mr.Ju!

38:22.960 --> 38:24.559
Someone's here for you.

38:24.559 --> 38:27.119
Come in. Look at this.

38:36.214 --> 38:38.285
You're Mr.Ju?

38:42.119 --> 38:43.320
Can I help you?

38:44.320 --> 38:45.400
You know each other?

38:45.400 --> 38:47.880
Then Wu, I'll come back for it when it's fixed.

38:47.880 --> 38:48.999
I'll head out first.

38:48.999 --> 38:50.499
Okay.

38:53.720 --> 38:55.599
What's the problem?

38:55.599 --> 38:57.720
My laptop got wet. The screen is black.

38:57.720 --> 39:00.280
The tricycle driver said you could fix it.

39:06.760 --> 39:08.800
Stolen yesterday, in for repair today.

39:08.800 --> 39:10.960
This laptop is quite unlucky with you.

39:10.960 --> 39:13.400
I haven't had a single lucky day
since I got here.

39:37.720 --> 39:39.110
Why did you open it all up?

39:39.110 --> 39:42.015
Do you know how to fix it? Don't break it.

39:50.960 --> 39:52.639
Don't worry.

39:56.519 --> 39:58.199
Wipe your sweat.

39:59.679 --> 40:01.479
Don't let it drip on my desk.

40:50.240 --> 40:52.679
Don't worry. Have some water.

40:53.679 --> 40:55.639
Leave everything to Mr.Ju.

40:57.097 --> 40:58.240
I'm Canine.

40:58.240 --> 40:59.308
Wu's brother,

40:59.308 --> 41:00.720
and also half-owner here.

41:01.720 --> 41:02.960
I'm Qing Ye.

41:02.960 --> 41:04.690
Thank you.

41:04.690 --> 41:07.360
You can trust Wu's technical skills.

41:17.343 --> 41:19.079
How is it?

41:19.079 --> 41:20.999
A component on the motherboard is fried.

41:20.999 --> 41:22.519
It needs to be replaced.

41:22.519 --> 41:24.039
Can it be fixed by 10:00 p.m. tonight?

41:24.039 --> 41:25.199
I need it urgently.

41:25.199 --> 41:26.479
It's possible,

41:26.479 --> 41:28.084
but it'll be expensive.

41:28.084 --> 41:29.337
Money is no object.

41:29.337 --> 41:30.639
As long as you can fix it.

41:30.639 --> 41:32.760
Will the data inside be safe?

41:32.760 --> 41:34.583
I can't guarantee that.

41:38.332 --> 41:39.760
What?

41:39.760 --> 41:41.014
Got money again?

41:41.014 --> 41:42.133
Never mind that.

41:42.133 --> 41:44.972
I'll transfer the room fee to you as well.

41:50.760 --> 41:51.800
What are you doing?

41:51.800 --> 41:54.479
Are you going to fix my laptop, or what?

41:54.479 --> 41:56.880
The replacement part is in Xuan Island.

41:56.880 --> 41:59.479
If you're coming, keep up.

42:05.790 --> 42:07.961
He's out! He's out!

42:18.400 --> 42:19.937
Put this on.

42:19.937 --> 42:22.079
How am I supposed to sit on this?

42:24.479 --> 42:25.760
What are you looking at?

42:25.760 --> 42:27.679
My apologies.

42:30.960 --> 42:32.039
Get on.

42:32.039 --> 42:33.539
I...

43:03.199 --> 43:04.999
Fasten it yourself.

43:31.280 --> 43:32.443
Need some help?

43:32.443 --> 43:34.360
No, I'm good.
